order. In a trial where units arrive one by one, use \code{\link[=scr_next]{scr_next()}} to
assign each new arrival; with the same random seed, calling
\code{\link[=scr_next]{scr_next()}} repeatedly gives exactly the same assignments as \code{SCR()}.
